---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { getLangFromUrl, useTranslations } from "../../i18n/utils";
import { SmallForm } from "../../components/SmallForm";
import photo from "../../assets/imagess/rfid.jpg";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

const theLang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const t = useTranslations(theLang as "en" | "es");
---

<Layout
  title="Radio Frequency Identification"
  description={`We develop mobile applications tailored to the specific requirements of businesses looking to enhance their internal productivity and interaction with their customers.`}
>
  <h1
    class="w-full py-5 laptop:py-8 bg-blue text-[22px] tablet:text-[26px] laptop:text-3xl
font-extrabold text-center text-white"
  >
    Radio Frequency Identification (RFID)
  </h1>
  <main class="flex flex-col full:flex-row w-full">
    <section
      class="grow flex flex-col px-4 pt-10 pb-16 laptop:px-16 gap-6 items-start"
    >
      <div class="w-full flex flex-col gap-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl laptop:text-4xl font-bold">RFID</h2>
        <p class="text-left">
          At PC Apps International LLC, we offer RFID (Radio Frequency
          Identification) technology solutions designed to <strong
            >optimize and transform your business’s inventory management and
            logistical operations</strong
          >. By contracting our RFID technology services, you will gain multiple
          added values that will significantly benefit your company.
        </p>
      </div>
      <Image src={photo} alt={"Service Image"} class={`w-full rounded-lg`} />
      <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold pt-6">What Does It Involve?</h3>
      <ol
        class="flex flex-col items-start gap-3 list-inside list-decimal text-justify marker:text-xl marker:font-semibold"
      >
        <li>
          <span class="font-semibold text-xl"
            >Customized Implementation and Consulting:</span
          >
          <ul class="pl-12 py-4 list-disc list-inside flex flex-col gap-4">
            <li>
              <span class="font-semibold">Added Value:</span> Our experts work closely
              with your team to design and implement an RFID system that perfectly
              fits your business's specific needs. We provide continuous consulting
              and technical support to ensure a smooth integration.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="font-semibold">Benefits:</span> Maximizes the efficiency
              of the RFID system, ensures a seamless transition, and minimizes disruptions
              to daily operations.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="font-semibold text-xl"
            >Accuracy and Real-Time Visibility:
          </span>
          <ul class="pl-12 py-4 list-disc list-inside flex flex-col gap-4">
            <li>
              <span class="font-semibold">Added Value:</span> RFID systems provide
              accurate, real-time data on the location and status of products in
              your inventory. This eliminates human errors and improves data accuracy.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="font-semibold">Benefits:</span> Enhanced inventory visibility,
              reduction of losses and discrepancies, and better decision-making based
              on accurate data.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="font-semibold text-xl"
            >Process Automation and Cost Reduction:
          </span>
          <ul class="pl-12 py-4 list-disc list-inside flex flex-col gap-4">
            <li>
              <span class="font-semibold">Added Value:</span> With RFID technology,
              many manual processes can be automated, significantly reducing the
              time and effort required for inventory management.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="font-semibold">Benefits:</span> Operational cost savings,
              increased staff productivity, and freeing up resources for more strategic
              tasks.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="font-semibold text-xl"
            >Enhanced Security and Control:
          </span>
          <ul class="pl-12 py-4 list-disc list-inside flex flex-col gap-4">
            <li>
              <span class="font-semibold">Added Value:</span> RFID technology allows
              comprehensive and secure tracking of products from production to point
              of sale. This enhances asset security and reduces the risk of theft
              or loss.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="font-semibold">Benefits:</span> Greater inventory control,
              reduction of losses, and protection of valuable assets.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="font-semibold text-xl"
            >Scalability and Adaptability:
          </span>
          <ul class="pl-12 py-4 list-disc list-inside flex flex-col gap-4">
            <li>
              <span class="font-semibold">Added Value:</span> Our RFID systems are
              designed to grow with your business. They are highly scalable and can
              easily adapt to changes in demand or business expansions. - **Benefits:**
              Flexibility to meet future needs, ensuring a long-term investment that
              continues to provide value as your business grows.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="font-semibold">Benefits:</span> Customer trust and loyalty,
              compliance with data protection regulations, and reduced risk of security
              breaches.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="font-semibold text-xl"
            >Integration with Existing Systems:
          </span>
          <ul class="pl-12 py-4 list-disc list-inside flex flex-col gap-4">
            <li>
              <span class="font-semibold">Added Value:</span> We offer solutions
              that seamlessly integrate with your existing inventory management and
              ERP (Enterprise Resource Planning) systems, ensuring smooth interoperability.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="font-semibold">Benefits:</span> Improved operational efficiency,
              consolidation of data into a unified system, and reduction of information
              redundancy.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section
      class="bg-sectionBg w-full min-[1500px]:min-w-[800px] full:min-w-[460px] flex flex-col items-center gap-8 px-4 tablet:px-4
      laptop:px-8 py-12"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-center">
          {t("nav.contactBtn")}
        </h3>
        <p class="text-center">{t("contact.formText")}</p>
      </div>
      <SmallForm lang={theLang} client:only />
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
